.\" Manpage for worgenX-gui
.TH WORGENX-GUI 1 "October 2026" "1.2.7" "worgenX GUI Manual"
.SH NAME
worgenx_gui \- Graphical interface for the WorgenX software
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B worgenx_gui
.SH DESCRIPTION
worgenx_gui provides a user-friendly graphical interface (usable in a terminal) for the WorgenX software, allowing users to perform various tasks such as generating wordlists, random passwords, and conducting CPU benchmarking with ease, only by following the menus.
.SH OPTIONS
There are no command-line options for worgenx_gui.
.SH "USAGE EXAMPLE"
Launch the worgenX-gui application from the applications menu or by running 'worgenx_gui' in the terminal.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
For more information, refer to the README file or visit the project page at https://github.com/XenorInspire/WorgenX.
